                              VPC
                    Virtual Private Cloud
                             --------------> Networking

--> VPC is a virtual network or datacenter inside AWS for one client.
--> It is logically isolated from the other virtual networks in the AWS cloud.
--> max 5 VPC  can be created in region and 200 subnets in 1 VPC
--> once we created VPC, DHCP, NACL and security group willl be created automatically.
(DHCP : Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol)
--> once the VPC is created, you can not changed its CIDR
--> if you need different CIDR size then created new VPC
--> Different subnets within VPC can not overlap.

Two types of VPC:
1. Default VPC
2. Custom VPC

